                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Mark absent students as excused with reasons and track who approved each excuse.</p>
                      </div>
                      
                      <div class="border-t pt-3" :class="isCOE ? 'border-orange-200' : 'border-blue-200'">
